  "implementation": [
    "SQL-versioned metadata can project an observation only when its exact Connection/data_version/schema_version/total_changes/clock/source stamp remains unchanged before and after the projection. This path acquires no file reader and returns no executable grant.",
    "The native lifetime poll may use only a positive unchanged expiry observation to keep the original custodian alive. Missing/changed/clock-edge metadata returns through the original fully fenced read before any retirement decision. Current runtime owner and original expiry remain checked.",
    "A narrow role hint returns only the current unchanged role string. Service compares it with Core and may skip a disposable no-op projection. Missing or changed roles take the existing complete fresh role read, exact source set, held role mutation and current owner/activation checks. The hint cannot authorize applying a role or performing IO."
